# --- Security / hygiene (added 2026-06-07) ---
# One-off operational scripts contain customer PII (names/emails).
# Ignore the whole dir so new scripts can never be committed by accident.
# Already-tracked scripts stay tracked; this only blocks NEW untracked files.
scripts/

